	"nodes":[
		{"id":"205ae4048d21f49f","type":"text","text":"## Risk Management Process\n\nIterative process to identity and manage uncertainty, minimising impact of adverse events whilst capturing value creating opportunities.\n\n![[Pasted image 20261113164250.png|593]]\n\n#### Set Objectives\n\nDefines the framework by establishing risk tolerance a firm is willing to bear.\n\n#### Detect & Identify Events\n\nUncovers full spectrum of internal and external events, capturing emerging threats or opportunities.\n\n#### Assess & Prioritise risk\n\nEvaluates risks by expected frequency and severity of impact relying on key risk measures as early warning indicators when exposure rises.\n\n#### Select a Risk Response\n\nAligns company exposure with risk tolerance by establishing internal risk limits.\n\n#### Control & Monitor\n\nExecutes ongoing control activities and adopts Enterprise Risk Management (ERM) to manage risks across the firm in an integrated framework rather than isolated silos.\n","x":-1240,"y":-600,"width":1320,"height":1000}
	],
